        fans, which can hold several.
      </p>

      <div
        class="sticky top-[calc(var(--layout-nav-height)+4px)] z-20 mt-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-md border border-border-subtle bg-surface px-2 py-1 shadow-sm lg:hidden"
        data-mobile-status
      >
        <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1">
          <span
            class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border border-border-strong bg-surface-muted px-2.5 py-0.5 text-micro text-text-secondary"
            data-mobile-badge
          >
            No components selected
          </span>
          <p class="text-micro text-text-secondary" data-mobile-counts>
            Add components to run compatibility checks.
          </p>
        </div>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="btn btn-ghost shrink-0 px-2 text-caption"
